      "body": "@A_K - May I ask why you object to frequent use of saline? Saline is safe and effective; it&#39;s basically mucus without the proteins that make mucus &quot;mucusy&quot;. It thins mucus, shrinks swollen nasal mucosa a bit making nose-breathing easier, is all-natural, and cheap (you can make it at home and make sure it&#39;s sterile.)"
